{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — clinical, safety-first aromatherapy consultations and custom blends in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724;
      --glass-1: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --glass-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --accent-start:#9be7ff;
      --accent-end:#a6f3c5;
      --muted:#9aa4b2;
      --card-radius:18px;
      --max-width:980px;
      color-scheme: dark;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#07111a);background-attachment:fixed}
    /* SVG pattern background */
    body::before{
      content:"";
      position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-2;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');
      background-repeat:repeat;opacity:0.08;mix-blend-mode:screen;
      transform: translateZ(0);
    }
    /* soft radial glow */
    body::after{
      content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-3;
      background: radial-gradient(800px 400px at 10% 10%, rgba(155,231,255,0.06), transparent 8%), radial-gradient(600px 300px at 90% 90%, rgba(166,243,197,0.05), transparent 8%);
    }
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-start),var(--accent-end));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#052024;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0;color:#e6f9f2}
    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}

    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass-1),var(--glass-2));color:#eafff7}

    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:24px}
    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wrap{padding:18px}}

    .card{background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:var(--card-radius);padding:20px;backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(120%);box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:26px 26px 18px}
    .hero h2{margin:0;font-size:20px;color:#e6f9f2}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],input[type=date],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);background:transparent;color:#eafaf1;outline:none}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .col{flex:1}

    .submit-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:flex-start}
    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-start),var(--accent-end));color:#052024;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px}

    /* Sidebar info */
    .info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .meta svg{width:18px;height:18px;opacity:0.9}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    .map{height:160px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(0,0,0,0.2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    footer{margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* small legal panel */
    .safety{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), rgba(255,255,255,0.005));padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}

    /* subtle focus outlines */
    input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(155,231,255,0.04);border-color:rgba(155,231,255,0.12)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">A</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Treatments</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Fees</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="card">
        <div class="hero">
          <h2>Reach out to {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — clinical, considerate aromatherapy</h2>
          <p>Use this form to request an appointment, ask about a custom blend, or inquire about safety and dilution. We prioritize evidence-informed guidance and client safety; we do not diagnose or treat medical conditions.</p>
        </div>

        <form id="contactForm" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post" novalidate>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col">
              <label for="name">Full name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>

          <div class="row">
            <div class="col">
              <label for="service">I'm contacting about</label>
              <select id="service" name="service">
                <option>New consultation</option>
                <option>Follow-up</option>
                <option>Custom blend</option>
                <option>Retail order</option>
                <option>Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <label for="date">Preferred date</label>
              <input id="date" name="date" type="date">
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for="message">Message — goals, sensitivities, pets, pregnancy, current topical/medication use</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your goals and any safety considerations (skin sensitivities, pets at home, pregnancy, current topical meds)." required></textarea>

          <div class="safety">
            <strong>Safety first:</strong> Aromatherapy complements wellbeing practices but is not a replacement for medical care. We avoid offering clinical diagnoses or treatment claims. If you are pregnant, nursing, have serious health concerns, or are using prescription medications, please note that when you contact us. We will advise on safe dilution, patch-testing, and pet-friendly considerations.
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:8px">
            <input id="consent" name="consent" type="checkbox" required>
            <label for="consent" class="muted">I consent to being contacted by {{BUSINESS_NAME}} and acknowledge this is not medical advice.</label>
          </div>

          <div class="submit-row">
            <button class="btn-primary" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <button class="btn-ghost" type="button" onclick="prefill()">Quick note: blend inquiry</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <footer>
          <p class="muted">Prefer to call? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent-start);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a> — or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent-start);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </footer>
      </section>

      <aside class="card">
        <div class="info">
          <div>
            <h3 style="margin:0;color:#e6f9f2;font-size:15px">Visit / Studio Info</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Clinic-style sessions in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} by appointment. Hybrid offerings: in-person consultations and remote video sessions available.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="meta">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <div>
              <div style="color:#e6f9f2">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
              <div class="muted">By appointment — hybrid model</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="meta">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <div>
              <div style="color:#e6f9f2">Hours</div>
              <div class="muted">Mon–Fri 9:00–17:00 • Sat limited</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="meta">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21 8V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M3 6v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <div>
              <div style="color:#e6f9f2">Booking</div>
              <div class="muted">Secure online booking via the Book page — or request availability here.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="map" role="img" aria-label="Map placeholder">Map preview (in production: interactive map)</div>

          <div class="safety" style="margin-top:6px">
            Note: For pregnant or nursing clients, persons with epilepsy, or infants, essential oil use requires specific planning. Mention these in your message and we will follow safety-first guidance, including recommended dilutions and patch testing.
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Minimal client-side validation and helpful UX
    (function(){
      var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        var email = document.getElementById('email');
        if(!email.value || !email.checkValidity()){ e.preventDefault(); alert('Please enter a valid email address.'); email.focus(); return false }
        var consent = document.getElementById('consent');
        if(!consent.checked){ e.preventDefault(); alert('Please confirm consent to be contacted.'); consent.focus(); return false }
        // allow submit to server / configured endpoint
      });
    })();
    function prefill(){
      document.getElementById('service').value = 'Custom blend';
      document.getElementById('message').value = 'Hello — I am interested in a custom blend focused on relaxation. Please advise on safe dilution and pet considerations.';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# contact.html — Contact page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\n\nThis bundle contains the contact page and instructions for the aromatherapy practice site. It follows the clinical_calm voice and glass_morphism layout family. The page is safety-forward and hybrid-offer friendly.\n\nFiles included in this chunk:\n- contact.html — a standalone contact page with a clinical tone, consent checkbox, safety notes (pregnancy, pets, patch testing), and a basic form (POSTs to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}).\n\nPlaceholders to replace or supply when building the site:\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\n- {{TAGLINE}}\n- {{PHONE}}\n- {{EMAIL}}\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\n- {{CITY}}\n- {{STATE}}\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\n- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}} (not used on this page but present across the project)\n\nNotes and implementation details:\n- Visuals are implemented with CSS glass-morphism, gradients, and an SVG pattern background referenced at assets/img/pattern.svg. Ensure that file exists; it should be a small repeating SVG to add texture.\n- No external fonts or CDNs are used; the page relies on system fonts.\n- The page emphasizes safety: it includes a consent checkbox and a clear non-medical disclaimer. For pregnant, nursing, or otherwise vulnerable clients the copy asks them to note this in the message so the practitioner can recommend appropriate dilution and patch testing.\n- The contact form uses basic client-side validation and posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Adapt server-side handling to meet privacy and security requirements (HTTPS, anti-spam, GDPR/CCPA considerations).\n- Navigation labels use a slightly different set of labels to vary wording across templates (e.g., "Treatments", "Fees", "Connect"). Keep links as: index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html.\n\nAccessibility & progressive enhancement:\n- Form uses semantic HTML, labels, and ARIA-friendly structures.\n- The map is an accessible placeholder; replace with an interactive map component if desired.\n\nStyling and customization tips:\n- Colors are declared in :root; tweak --accent-start and --accent-end to shift the brand gradient.\n- The glass blur/backdrop-filter is used; for older browsers fallback is handled by the low-opacity background colors.\n- To change the hero tone, edit the hero h2 and paragraph copy to reflect the practitioner voice while remaining safety-focused.\n\nLegal & safety:\n- The copy intentionally avoids medical claims. Make sure all other pages (blends, services, pricing) follow the same constraint and include dilution and patch-test guidance in the FAQ.\n\nIf you need an assets package (SVG pattern, illustrations, or icon set), add assets/img/pattern.svg and any other assets referenced by the other pages in the project."}
BUNDLE_END
